  "accuracy_notes": "R3 softens the hood and collar, removes the exposed rigid neck connector, thins and rounds the swept fins, and adds a baked elbow bend, open mitten, lean, and clearer step. The hood collar still has projecting tips; the fins are thinner than the character sheet shows in side view; and the raised hand overlaps the headphone silhouette. The gesture is a static mesh pose with no rig or animation. Fin inset gradients use COLOR_0. Emission and bolder inverted-hull outlines survive GLB export, while bloom remains renderer-dependent. Helmet and visor contours, headphones, clothing folds, boots, shorts, and Bfont lettering remain simplified geometric interpretations. PBR shading and uniform outlines differ from the illustration. The private character sheet is not redistributed, and exact fidelity or independent art approval is not claimed.",
